WEBVTT

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.070
The Swamp Witch's curse is spreading.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.280
But...

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.080
You must be pretty scared if you're shooting people on sight.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.590
You must be an underling of the Swamp Witch

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.750
to be wandering around in a place like this.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.130
Initiating divine punish...ment?

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.850
It's been a while, Laila.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.260
Can you eat mushrooms now?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.810
Huh?

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:43.140
Eilin-san?

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.070
I was wrong?

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.530
I was born crying alone.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:01:00.030
In a horizon of light and darkness.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:05.370
Why not obtain these bonds.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:13.720
They were shining in my hands just now.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:26.600
The melancholy of one in sever billion.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.940
Someday the end of the world will come.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:37.320
So what? I'll have no regret.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:45.750
Say, yeah!! Stop running straight after that falling star.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.540
Let your worries fade away!!

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.840
This blue Earth is nestled in the sky.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:01.180
Like I always envisioned Elysium.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:06.520
I will shape my own past and future.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:11.900
I will look up to the eternal Stellar.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:17.320
I can hear the song of life.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.990
Aneja! Where do you think you're going?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.280
Nee-nee...

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.660
Onii-chan!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.670
What's going on, you guys?!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.090
Sorry...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.840
When I started thinking about how you might disappear again,

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.760
I got worried...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.760
It's your fault for running away in the first place.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.350
I believed in Onii-chan the whole time, though.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.930
No fair.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.900
You trying to win points with her?

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.650
That's not it!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.320
Yes, it is!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.030
Besides, you were the ones that...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:38.980
You trying to start something?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.360
It's okay. I'm happy...

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.030
I'm happy to have so many little sisters

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.370
that care about me so much.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:49.910
Little sisters?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.210
Is that weird?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.830
Everyone calls me their older sister, so I thought it'd be fine...

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.790
Say it again!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.800
Huh? Little sisters...

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:00.920
Onii-chan!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.800
Nee-nee!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.880
Aneja!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.880
Nee-san!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.010
Onee-sama!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.140
Aneja...

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.440
Jeez! Cut it out already!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:21.190
Hm, so you're investigating  the Swamp Witch.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.700
That's right.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.990
The swamp is completely contaminated,

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.450
to the point where people can't live there anymore.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.990
I can't sense any monsters, though.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.330
It's kind of strange.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:38.670
I had heard a rumor that that area held potential as a gem mine

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.090
so I was doing some research,

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.010
but it seems that wasn't the case.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.590
But don't you worry.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.050
If I ask Ymir-nee, you should be

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.010
able to see the Queen right away.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.730
You must have pretty good luck for an angel,

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.230
given that you ran into me right after you came down to the surface.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.320
Yes, the archangel that I'm serving

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.320
has exceptionally good luck.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.900
She's been called the Angel of Miracles.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.400
That might have something to do with it.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.250
Elina seems to be doing her job,

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.790
but Annelotte continues to walk free.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.960
If we continue to let her live, she'll eventually

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.340
become an obstacle for a certain someone...

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.760
I have a trump card prepared just in case, but...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.270
Ymir-chan!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.310
Open up!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.980
Mmm!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.860
What are you doing?

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.030
It's the lunch I made for my husband.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.780
No matter how far we are apart,

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:55.410
it's a wife's duty to deliver three meals a day,

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.910
full of nutrition and love.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.130
He's going to get fat if he eats this much.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.290
You know, you're pretty hard on your summons.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.130
It's your punishment for leaving the other day.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:08.130
We'll do anything you want!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.840
They don't look it,

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.430
but they're actually famous nobles in the underworld...

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.890
And in such a short period of time,

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.600
she's managed to practically get them to be her servants...

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.640
She may have lost her memories,

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.980
but I can see why she was a two-time winner of

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.110
the Queen's Blade and a former Queen.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:27.650
I'd like you to hurry and take care of Annelotte.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.740
What?

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.450
But... If I leave the castle, I won't be able to cook.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.790
I suppose I could take day trips, but I'd need to come back...

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.630
Onii-chan.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.380
Nee-nee...

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.300
It'd be nice if we could do this every day.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.850
- Onii-chan.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.850
- This is nice.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:59.690
Everyone, I'm thinking of going to see Queen Claudette.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.100
What?!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:05.730
I've lost a lot of friends to the Queen's army.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.190
But I've seen a lot of people happy

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.900
because the Queen has changed the world into a place

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.410
where people can be free and are treated equally.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.990
I want to see what Queen Claudette really desires,

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.370
and if it is something that will simply

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.040
cause more people to suffer...

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.380
I will take down the Queen.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.010
Wow! Nee-nee, you're so cool!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.470
You're the best, Onii-chan!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.470
But how are you going to meet with her?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.180
She should just go and say hi!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.560
There was that secret entrance.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.020
The guards know about that now

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.730
thanks to a certain <i>someone</i> who followed us in.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.730
They found me.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.700
T-That girl is really hopeless.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.120
Don't act like it was someone else!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.910
I'm sure the security is a lot heavier now.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.130
It'll be fine, Onii-chan.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.040
Leave it to me.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.210
Yuit.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.800
I'll find a way for you to see the Queen.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.510
How?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.720
Logically, of course.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.890
I'll show you how Yuit does strategy.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.470
Right, Vante?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.270
It's a message from the chief.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.360
A rebellion in Earl Vance's territory?

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.070
An independence movement in the free city, Sheldanse.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.160
Armed farmers are gathering in Washirika Village.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.200
Wow! What a scoop!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.500
This is an extra! An extra!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.920
So my old, clumsy friend has become an envoy of heaven

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:58.470
and asked me to provide anaudience with the Queen,

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:01.270
so I asked Ymir-nee.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:05.310
I am the Divine Punishment Enforcer, Laila.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.690
Acting under orders from Archangel Nanael,

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.480
I have come to see the Thundercloud Queen.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.440
Nanael?!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.950
What could that dullard of an angel want with the Queen?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.280
She wants to know about the Swamp Witch.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:24.040
Nanael-sama has conveyed to me that the Witch's curse,

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.370
which dries the land and disrupts people's hearts,

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.080
is expanding at a rapid rate.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.380
We must inquire as to why Queen Claudette

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.300
is ignoring this dire situation.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.640
Depending on your response,

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.050
we believe it may be necessary to hold another battle

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.850
to elect a new Queen!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.310
Hey, that's going too far!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.640
All right!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.980
I had to memorize the whole thing, but I managed to say it!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.690
I beg your pardon.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.820
Could you explain what you mean in more simple terms?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.990
Huh?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.570
Y-You want me to say it again...?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.870
I'm just an angel-in-training,

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.790
so it might be...

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.000
a little hard...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.120
for me to explain.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.630
Ymir-nee, you sure like teasing people.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.000
Can't you see you're making her uncomfortable?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:19.180
Don't worry. The Queen is thinking about the future of the continent!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:22.050
There's no threat from the witch at all,

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.260
and there's no need for another Queen's Blade!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:28.020
B-But the Witch's s-swamp is growing larger...

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.440
And it's strange that we can't find the witch anywhere...

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.020
B-Besides, I have to report back to Nanael-sama—

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.790
H-Huh?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.460
She didn't move at all...

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.370
She reacted instantly with only her fighting spirit?!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:51.920
You see?

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.290
When the Queen gets serious,

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.010
even an angel like you ends up like that.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.630
Not to mention she has me, the genius weapon designer

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.550
and Iron Strategist Ymir, by her side.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.640
This country will become a free and enjoyable

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.060
country under her great power.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.310
That was crazy...

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.060
But she is the Queen after all.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:17.570
She knocked my Dwaven hammer all the way over there.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.830
T-This is bad! This is bad!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.700
She can't be human!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:31.290
Nanael-sama! This is bad!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.460
A theft in Shai-Fang...

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.880
People form an army to combat the pirate, Liliana.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.930
Two beautiful sisters take charge.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.140
Let's see...

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.430
In a desert in the southern part of the continent,

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.930
a slug monster runs amuck...

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:55.360
Massive damage to a Queen's army camp.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.310
Is this good enough?

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.400
Yeah.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.150
Make it as exaggerated as you can.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.200
Yuit, is it really okay to write nothing but lies?

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.780
It's fine, Onii-chan.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.450
We should be seeing the effects soon.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.910
Now the Land of the Rising Sun is going

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.790
to practice military maneuvers near Gainos?!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.460
Wow, Chief!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.250
You keep giving me scoop after scoop!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.340
These are going to sell like hotcakes!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.210
Wait...

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:23.130
What's happening to this country?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.220
Excuse me!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:31.930
Ymir-sama.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:36.440
Now we've received reports of unrest in Sheldanse!

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.270
There's also a strange group causing problems in the Amara Desert.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.650
What's going on?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.860
Hurry up and dispatch the military and suppress them.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:45.700
Suppress them all!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.280
If you don't have enough soldiers, deploy the imperial guards, as well!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:51.080
Destroy all that oppose us!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.040
But...

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.420
Queen Claudette and I are here in this castle.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.130
Just the minimum number of soldiers will be sufficient.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.340
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.260
I've done what I can for now,

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.590
but what's going on?

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.060
Is someone actually planning on attacking the castle?

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.980
That might work out...

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:24.400
Maybe I'll get that certain someone to help set a trap.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.830
"It's bad for heaven to get involved too much."

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.450
"It's too early for me to show up."

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.620
Easy for her to say...

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.540
I always get the jobs no one else wants.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.130
Find the Wandering Warrior, Leina...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.170
How am I supposed to do that?

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.520
This has been a piece of cake so far!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.100
Shh! You're being too loud!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.140
Just as planned, the castle is lightly guarded.

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:00.480
So, this is where things get serious.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.570
The Queen is higher up in the castle.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:07.820
If we get closer, I should know a little about where to go.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.530
How about we ask someone?

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.620
You keep turning back and forth between black and white...

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.540
You should just stay gray.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.370
Let's not rush through this, okay?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.420
Onii-chan is right.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.840
Let's go over the mission one more time.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.040
It's fine.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.960
Sainyang, Lunaluna, and I are bait.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.470
We'll run around and cause a distraction, then run away, right?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.180
That's right. During that time Mirim, Onii-chan, and I

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.510
will head towards the Queen's room.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.470
Um...

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.350
What are we going to do with the wizard stones we're carrying?

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.140
The weapons the Queen's army uses are

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.020
increasingly being powered by wizard stones, so...

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.940
What's happening, Onii-chan!?

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:45.860
You're getting further away!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.410
What's going on?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.710
W-What is this?!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.400
I've been waiting for you, Annelotte!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.780
A trap, huh?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.160
That's right.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.450
Let me introduce you.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.800
Summoner Aldra, the person who will send you to your grave.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.350
We've been waiting for this!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.060
Huh?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.900
Just as Ymir-sama told us,

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.410
we've got ourselves quite a good-looking contender.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.910
You look strong...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.340
I like that.

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.600
Tarnyang, this is weird.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.980
Looks like we hit the jackpot, Sainyang.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.860
I don't know what's happening, Tarnyang,

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.820
but I'm excited.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.700
Let's go!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.590
Annelotte-san.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:17.470
I've heard that you seduce whoever's nearby, even women...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.800
For that I cannot forgive you!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.310
I won't give you my husband.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.270
What's this about?

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.160
You're good.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.870
I'll cook you, piece by piece.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:49.920
Belphe-san!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.340
You're going ahead with it already?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.300
Quite bold, aren't we?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.600
I-I can't believe you...

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:03.060
Doing this in front of other people...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:07.810
Dogor-san!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:12.730
I guess there's no choice if you want it so badly...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.320
It's overflowing...

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.780
Overflowing...

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.810
Eilin!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.810
Eilin!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.480
Where did you go...

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.020
Ymir-sama...

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.570
This is bad.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.910
I didn't want to fight her.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.020
S-She's strong...

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.060
At this rate...

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.190
I'll die!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.000
No way!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.900
What...is she?

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.090
This might be a stroke of luck.

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:12.780
Rebellions against the Queen

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:14.950
have been confirmed throughout the continent.

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:17.250
It is currently unknown how Queen Claudette

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:19.370
intends to handle the matter.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:22.330
Under orders from Archangel Nanael, I am beginning

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:24.380
my search for the winner of the previous Queen's Blade,

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:27.000
the Wandering Warrior, Leina.

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:30.170
I managed to say all of that...

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:33.260
Next time: "Wavering Spirit."

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.760
What's that?

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:36.600
I will purify this tainted armor in

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.600
accordance with the will of the heavens...?
